TO: CTY
CC: ASI/CCE
FROM: TAOBB/BETTY

Dear Ms Baek

Good day!
Firstly ,really thanks for your good support as always!!


For NCI/HTRC3009W, after checked and cargo adjusted, our final fcast is total 165T/2332TON, Alloc is 100T/1650Ton
PUS: 25T / 410Ton

HKG: 2T / 50Ton

JKT: 65T / 865Ton

SIN: 73T / 1007Ton



Know well you have supported much to our TAOBB, really appreciated Ms Baek. but for this vessel please do support some more space and weight, reason is :

1), According to your below G/L ,we have strictly control the weight, for HTRC3009W,the average weight is just 14Ton. As you know well, most cargo to JKT & SIN are heavy cargo,light cargo is very limited.

2), According to your below mail, our TAO/LYG's CMPB is the highest one, I think it is the key point.

3), This week, MD1 is blank voyage, we need use NCI to accept some more SIN cargo for balance.

4), According to ASI/CCE, our sector QTA is PUS:20T  HKG:10T  JKT:60T  SIN:30 Total QTA is 120T.



So please kindly consider our highest CMPB and support more 65T/682TON with much thks ,your any effort will be much much appreciated Ms Baek!! thks again!



b.rgds/betty



